  The reel_script says the police were led by 'காவல் உதவி ஆய்வாளர் செல்வம்' (Assistant Sub-Inspector), but the article only says 'எஸ்.ஐ., செல்வம்' (S.I. Selvam, Sub-Inspector); the rank is changed.
