factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The draft says Ragupathi was a government bus driver (அரசு பஸ் டிரைவர்) in the headline, reel and caption, but the article says he worked as an A.T.C. (ADC) driver, not a bus driver.
  The reel_script and slides say Ragupathi was going to work and that 'அவர் ஹெல்மெட் அணிந்திருக்கவில்லை' is presented as established fact, but the article says he was not wearing a helmet only as a detail; the slides claim 'ஹெல்மெட் அணியாமல் சென்றது விசாரணையில்' (established during investigation), which the article does not state.
  The caption and slides name the vehicle as 'எக்ஸல் சூப்பர் மொபட்' and mention the driver's name as 'சலாம்', but the reel_script omits the detail that the mobike's driver's father is Mohammed Ali; this is a minor omission and not an error.
  The article does not say the accident happened 'in the early hours' or any other timing beyond 'night 9:30'; the caption's date '(நவம்பர் 21, 2026)' is a posting-date claim, which is excluded, so no issue there.
  The reel_script says the accident was 'நேருக்கு நேர் மோதிய விபத்து' as the place 'எலச்சிபாளையத்தில', while the article says the accident took place in S. Mettupalayam area of Elachipalayam union, which is acceptable; however the slides state 'ரகுபதி (59 வயது) ஓட்டிய டூவீலர் மீது மோதல்' which wrongly implies the motorcycle was struck, a minor inconsistency with the article's head-on collision description.
