factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The caption's 🗓️ date line says 'நேற்று (22 நவம்பர்)' ('yesterday (22 November)'), which is an invented specific date not stated in the article; the article only gives the festival dates as the 15th and 16–21 without a month or year.
  The reel_script says the festival 'முடிவடைந்தது' (ended) yesterday and the caption says it 'முடிவு' (concluded); the article only describes the events of the day, and the article's 'நேற்று' refers to a day with the festival's main events, but the claim the whole festival concluded yesterday is not explicitly stated.
  The reel_script and slides say the 16–21 novena masses were 'நவநாள் திருப்பலி' without the officiating priests, which is acceptable, but the reel_script omits the key fact that the festival concluded with the Divya Nartkarunai blessing being part of the closing, which is present; however the reel_script omits the names of the presiding priests and the Trichy/Salem clergy (not required), so no issue there.
  The slides_spec 'hl2' headline 'மின் தேரில் திருவீதி உலா' and slide 'இரவு 7 மணிக்கு மின் தேரில் திருவீதி உலா நடந்தது' are consistent with the article, but the caption and reel_script describe the 'புதுநன்மை விழா' as a 'கூட்டுத்திருப்பலி' while the article calls it 'புதுநன்மை விழா, ஆடம்பர கூட்டுத்திருப்பலி' — acceptable wording.
  The reel_script states the 6 PM mass was a 'மறைமாவட்ட குருக்கள் தலைமையில் திருவிழா கூட்டுத்திருப்பலி' — the article says it was led by 'நாமக்கல் மறைமாவட்ட குருக்கள் தியோடர் செல்வராஜ்', consistent, so no issue.
